+"""
+Test setup. Safe by construction:
+  * needs TEST_DATABASE_URL and refuses to run unless the database name ends with "_test"
+  * refuses to run if it points at the same server/database as the live DATABASE_URL
+  * rebuilds the schema from the real SQL migrations (never from the models), so triggers,
+    views and constraints are exactly what production has
+Run:  see docs in README ("Running the tests") - docker compose --profile test ...
+"""
